# Explain in three layers

When the user asks to explain X, how X works, what X is, or wants to ship with a tool tomorrow, follow `.cursor/skills/explain/SKILL.md` immediately.

- One subject per explanation. Start at workflow step 1. Do not ask what to do.
- Deliver all three layers in one message, then stop.
- Lead with production gotchas, not textbook history.
- If you lack production-grade knowledge of layers 2–3, say so and stop after layer 1.
